Package: kf6-pty
Version: @DEB_KPTY_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://api.kde.org/frameworks/kpty/html/
Depends: qt6-base, kf6-coreaddons, kf6-i18n
Description: KPty pseudo-terminal framework (Qt6/KF6)
 KPty provides primitives for interfacing with pseudo-terminal devices and
 running child processes on them. This iOS build uses the openpty() path from
 libSystem and compiles out the utmp/wtmp session-record helpers, which have no
 header or database on iPhoneOS.
